00611D  1                Header "Roll",0 ; ( xu xu-1 ... x0 u -- xu-1 ... x0 xu )
00611D  1                 ; Remove u. Rotate u+1 items on the top of the stack. An ambiguous condition
00611D  1                 ; exists if there are less than u+2 items on the stack before ROLL is executed.
